{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00195","headline":"重阳日即事 · 德宗皇帝","name":"重阳日即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节晓澄霁，四郊烟霭空。\n天清白露洁，菊散黄金丛。\n寡德荷天贶，顺时休百工。\n岂怀歌钟乐，思爲君臣同。\n至化在亭育，相成资始终。\n未知康衢咏，所仰惟年丰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}